: earlier administrative work in data management and member affairs. Design stays my main craft; this is the operations side.`,adminSkills:`Tools and skills`,skillsList:[`Advanced Excel (data cleaning and processing)`,`SQL Server (fundamentals)`,`Microsoft Word`,`Records and member registration`,`Coordination between departments`,`Time management and multitasking`],jobs:[{when:`Aug 2024 – May 2025`,what:`Database Management`,where:`General Authority for Transport and Communications, Cairo`,pts:[`Managed and processed databases so they stay accurate and easy to access and analyze.`,`Cleaned data with advanced Excel and basic SQL.`]},{when:`Jan 2020 – Jul 2024`,what:`Administrative & Member Affairs Officer`,where:`Professional Syndicate for Injuries and Rehabilitation, Cairo`,pts:[`Handled member registration, documentation and support; kept member records organized and current.`,`Helped organize the "Life Basics Support and First Aid" program with the Egyptian Association of Sports Science and received a certificate of thanks.`]}],edu:`Education`,eduText:`LL.B. in Sharia and Law, Al-Azhar University (2023)`,langs:`Languages: Arabic (native), English (good)`,contactTitle:`Let's work together`,contactText:`Find me on Behance and LinkedIn.`,projects:{245562145:[`RICHO Restaurant`,`Visual identity & menu design`],109293507:[`ABDELHADI Perfume`,`Logo & brand identity`],245562509:[`SEE WORLD`,`Eyewear roll-up banner`],189450841:[`Sports rehab course`,`Poster design`],188645177:[`Coaching course`,`Facebook page design`],105371039:[`Sports training course`,`Facebook poster`]},skills:[`Graphic Design`,`Social Media`,`Photoshop`,`Illustrator`,`Brand Identity`,`Posters`,`AI Tools`]},ar:{dir:`rtl`,switchTo:`English`,work:`الأعمال`,admin:`الخبرة`,contact:`تواصل`,listView:`عرض القائمة`,view3d:`عرض ثلاثي الأبعاد`,role:`مصمم جرافيك · مدير سوشيال ميديا`,lead:`مصمم جرافيك ومدير سوشيال ميديا بخبرة تصميم تزيد على 8 سنوات. بوسترات وهويات بصرية ومحتوى سوشيال ميديا، من الجيزة، مصر.`,seeWor